                  "name": "Intro",
                  "fill": "#F0F6FC",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Local-first state management for TypeScript. Describe your state with a schema and Goodstate keeps it in conflict-free replicated data types (CRDTs), so changes made offline, in other tabs, or on other devices merge into the same result. Sync engines connect the store to IndexedDB, other tabs, or a server.",
